@moduledoc """
Encrypts attributes at rest through AshCloak: the TOTP secrets of multi-factor
authentication (`<%= inspect(@mfa_factor) %>`), and any attribute you encrypt the
same way. The key comes from `CLOAK_KEY` (see `config/runtime.exs`).

The cipher is AES-GCM, which authenticates the ciphertext. Do not switch to
`Cloak.Ciphers.AES.CTR`: it has no authentication.
"""

use Cloak.Vault, otp_app: <%= inspect(@app) %>
